    skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/571> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Drift Netting"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Areas characterised by commercial fishing using large nets that drift in the water, moved by currents and lacking any fixtures to keep them in place. They are rigged in a straight line and are generally used to catch pelagic or migratory species."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/571/concepts/151690> a skos:Concept ;
