    skos:scopeNote "Areas characterised by the regular commercial collection of naturally occurring shellfish stocks for food, bait or other products using a dredge towed behind a fishing vessel. In UK waters the target is usually scallops."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/571/concepts/151695> a skos:Concept ;
