    skos:scopeNote "Being in a state of busily undertaking commercially viable work; being a body undertaking such business."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/571/concepts/160156> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/571/concepts/151453> ;
    skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/571> ;
