    skos:scopeNote "Low-lying land often covered by water and usually with peaty vegetation. Used seasonally for grazing. Historically, peat was sometimes cut as domestic fuel and the area also used for trapping wildfowl."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/571/concepts/151163> a skos:Concept ;
