    skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/571> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Secondary Woodland"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Woodland that has developed, usually by natural colonization, on land formerly used for other purposes (agriculture, settlement, industry etc). If this process pre-dated 1600, secondary woodland can be classified as ancient woodland."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/571/concepts/151282> a skos:Concept ;
