    skos:scopeNote "Rural settlement in which  farmsteads are typically clustered together, normally as villages (and especially in the central province), but also as hamlets. Can also refer to a single nucleated settlement."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/571/concepts/151417> a skos:Concept ;
