    skos:scopeNote "A piece of ground over which small arms or large artillery may be fired at targets during training or exercises. Firing ranges regularly form components of much larger military practice areas."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/571/concepts/160133> a skos:Concept ;
