    skos:scopeNote "An area within an ornamentally designed landscape where owners and guests walked about for pleasure. Typically complex mixes of plantings, ornamental gardens and play areas (bowling, croquet, etc)."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/571/concepts/160285> a skos:Concept ;
